\begin_layout Standard
Butcher tableau has
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
\boldsymbol{A} & = & \left(I-\lambda_{0}\right)^{-1}\mu_{0}\\
\boldsymbol{b}^{\text{T}} & = & \mu_{1}\left(I-\lambda_{0}\right)^{-1}\mu_{0}
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset

So for the 2-stage implicit optimal scheme above:
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
A & = & \left(I-\left(\begin{array}{cc}
0 & 0\\
1 & 0
\end{array}\right)\right)^{-1}\left(\begin{array}{cc}
\frac{1}{2}\left(1-\sqrt{\frac{s-1}{s+1}}\right)\\
\frac{1}{2}\left(\sqrt{\frac{s+1}{s-1}}-1\right) & \frac{1}{2}\left(1-\sqrt{\frac{s-1}{s+1}}\right)
\end{array}\right)
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset


